## Vehicle telemetry offsets

UDS Mode 22 request IDs, CAN headers, and byte offsets implemented in
`IoniqUds.kt` were derived from public reverse-engineering of E-GMP OBD
broadcasts, in particular:

- [Esprit1st/Hyundai-Ioniq-5-Torque-Pro-PIDs](https://github.com/Esprit1st/Hyundai-Ioniq-5-Torque-Pro-PIDs)
  (no license file as of 2026-08-15)
- which itself notes an initial base in
  [JejuSoul/OBD-PIDs-for-HKMC-EVs](https://github.com/JejuSoul/OBD-PIDs-for-HKMC-EVs)
  (no license file as of 2026-08-15)

This repository does **not** vendor those CSV files. The Kotlin decoders are
an independent implementation of published CAN encodings, cross-checked against
captures from a vehicle. Before distributing commercially, confirm the
upstream authors' terms if you plan to copy their spreadsheets verbatim.

